  m_text: "Engineers use ABB RobotStudio to simulate and pre-program positioner movements
    before deployment.\n\nThe positioner\u2019s rotation angles, speeds, and synchronization
    with the robot are defined in a digital twin environment.\n\nThe system allows
    collision detection and optimized movement paths to ensure efficiency.\nAfter
    testing, the program is transferred to the real ABB controller for execution."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b036e831c0c90547b32a8a896d80f79, type: 2}
