  m_text: "ROS-Industrial (ROS-I) can be used to program the positioner dynamically
    based on real-time feedback.\n\nSensor data (e.g., part misalignment detection)
    can be used to adjust the positioner\u2019s movement on the fly.\n\nMoveIt! and
    Gazebo can be used to simulate and optimize the positioning in a virtual environment.\n\nExample
    of ROS motion planning for an external axis(python)\npositioner_goal = PoseStamped()\r\npositioner_goal.pose.position.x
    = 0.5\r\npositioner_goal.pose.orientation.w = 1.0\r\nmove_group.set_pose_target(positioner_goal)\r\nmove_group.go(wait=True)\r\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b036e831c0c90547b32a8a896d80f79, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2427308795250815149, guid: 5b036e831c0c90547b32a8a896d80f79, type: 2}
