  m_text: "Path Definition: Using ABB RobotStudio, pre-programmed welding paths are
    created based on precise waypoints.\n\nMotion Commands: RAPID code defines the
    robot\u2019s linear (MoveL), joint-based (MoveJ), or circular (MoveC) motions
    for accurate torch positioning.\n\nSpeed & Torch Angle Control: Parameters like
    welding speed, travel angles, and dwell times are pre-set to maintain welding
    quality.\n\nTeach Pendant Interaction: Users can interactively program and refine
    weld paths using the ABB FlexPendant, simulating real-world operator adjustments.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b036e831c0c90547b32a8a896d80f79, type: 2}
