    - target: {fileID: 4856247519295384336, guid: 2c399890a7430fe4a947f5b82242ca81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Dual-Axis Motion \u2013 The workpiece will tilt (axis 1) and rotate
        (axis 2) to keep weld joints in the best possible position.\n\nAutomatic
        Synchronization \u2013 The movement of the positioner and the welding robot
        is carefully coordinated, just like in real-world manufacturing.\n\nPrecision
        Control \u2013 The system ensures each weld is applied at the correct angle
        and speed, simulating real-world industrial standards."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4856247519295384336, guid: 2c399890a7430fe4a947f5b82242ca81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_VerticalAlignment
      value: 256
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4905432961652785928, guid: 2c399890a7430fe4a947f5b82242ca81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'ABB IRBP D300-D1000, a dual-axis robotic positioner designed to improve
        welding precision and efficiency

        It has two synchronized rotary
        axes, meaning it can tilt and rotate the workpiece simultaneously for optimal
        welding angles.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4905432961652785928, guid: 2c399890a7430fe4a947f5b82242ca81, type: 3}
